          "\"This is a strongly connected components problem because the graph is directed and we're looking for mutual reachability. I'll use Kosaraju's algorithm: first run DFS on the original graph and record nodes by finishing time, reverse all edges, then run DFS in reverse finishing order. Each DFS in the second pass identifies one SCC.\""
